 "_swfapi_recipeRemainder_basis": "FabricItem / FabricItemStack.getRecipeRemainder answered an ItemStack in 1.21.11 (EMPTY for none); 26.1's getCraftingRemainder answers an ItemStackTemplate (null for none). Calls convert 26.1's answer (CbFapiItems.stack), dispatched virtually so the item's override answers; super calls run 1.21.11's default bodies; overrides are reached through 26.1's shape (overrideHooks).",
 "_swfapi_tagRemoval_basis": "26.1's Fabric API dropped tag removal: FabricTagFile.remove() and the \"fabric:remove\" list of tag files (loaded and applied by 1.21.11's TagLoaderMixin, mixin/CbFapiTagLoaderMixin + rt/CbFapiTagRemovals, 1.21.11's TagRemovalInternals member for member), and datagen's FabricProvidedTagBuilder.remove/removeAll/removeTag (recorded on the TagBuilder, written into the TagFile: CbFapiTagBuilderMixin, CbFapiTagsProviderMixin, CbFapiTagFileMixin). As in 1.21.11 only vanilla's builder-backed appender removes; any other appender and a mod's super call get 1.21.11's AssertionError(\"Implemented via mixin\").",
 "fieldRedirects": {
  "net/fabricmc/fabric/api/client/rendering/v1/world/WorldRenderEvents.BEFORE_ENTITIES:Lnet/fabricmc/fabric/api/event/Event;": "top/dext/centurybridge/step/v26_1/compat/fapi/client/rendering/v1/world/CbWorldRenderEvents",
