  "net/fabricmc/fabric/api/resource/v1/reloader/ResourceReloaderKeys$Client.BLOCK_RENDER_MANAGER:Lnet/minecraft/class_2960;": "top/dext/centurybridge/step/v26_1/rt/CbFapiReloadKeys"
 },
 "_swfapi_worldRender_basis": "WorldRenderEvents' BEFORE_ENTITIES / AFTER_ENTITIES / BEFORE_DEBUG_RENDER / BEFORE_TRANSLUCENT are gone in 26.1's LevelRenderEvents: given back with 1.21.11's listener types (CbWorldRenderEvents) and fired at the matching points of 26.1's main pass (CbFapiLevelRendererMixin) with the frame's render context; WorldExtractionContext's frustum / viewMatrix / cullProjectionMatrix / blockOutlines read off the camera and GameRenderer (CbFapiWorldContexts)",
